BT /F2 9 Tf 0.4 g 72 711 Td (HARBORLINE ELECTRIC) Tj ET
BT /F2 20 Tf 0.1 g 72 681 Td (Electrical safety program) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.35 g 72 665 Td (Issued by Jordan Avery on January 12, 2026) Tj ET
BT /F2 11.5 Tf 0.1 g 72 636 Td (Purpose) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.15 g 72 617 Td (This program sets out how Harborline Electric keeps its crews safe around energized equipment. It) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.15 g 72 602 Td (applies to every employee and every job site.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11.5 Tf 0.1 g 72 573 Td (De-energize first) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.15 g 72 554 Td (Equipment is placed in an electrically safe work condition before work begins: disconnected, locked) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.15 g 72 539 Td (and tagged out, and tested for absence of voltage. Energized work requires a written permit signed) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.15 g 72 524 Td (by the owner.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11.5 Tf 0.1 g 72 495 Td (Arc-flash labels) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.15 g 72 476 Td (Every panel and switchgear section we service carries a current arc-flash label. Missing or outdated) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.15 g 72 461 Td (labels are reported as an issue on the day they are found.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11.5 Tf 0.1 g 72 432 Td (Training) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.15 g 72 413 Td (Every field employee completes electrical safety training on hire and every three years after, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.15 g 72 398 Td (signs an acknowledgment in Balebase.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.35 g 488.85 40 Td (Page 1 of 1) Tj ET
